<title>INDIA: IDBI Mutual's Call I-Nit'97 NAV at 10.188 rupees.</title>
<headline>IDBI Mutual's Call I-Nit'97 NAV at 10.188 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDBI Mutual funds money market scheme - Call I-Nit'97 NAV as on August 4, 1997 was 10.188 rupees.</p>
<p>The NAV has progressed from 10.141 on July 15 to 10.188 rupees.</p>
<p>The scheme is open for resale on a daily basis at NAV plus a load of 0.1 percent of NAV.</p>
<p>For futher details, call Chandrashekhar at 284 6436,38,52,66</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
